      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "I will cut off the beautiful and delicate one, the daughter of Zion.",
      "ko": "아름답고 묘한 딸 시온을 내가 멸절하리니",
      "source_text_hash": "f2a3a94b66524de3e5021ae247ba99c22cff3e76856fc9bb1d54747758f736d2",
      "translation_text_hash": "d16bcda4b8d4006cb6add6f52d401d5a31ac294e09497a18aca76ef2a07d1aa0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
