      "en": "Arise! Let’s go up by night, and let’s destroy her palaces.”",
      "ko": "일어나라 우리가 밤으로 올라가서 그 전각들을 헐자 하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "f91a2bc619c7ff2348346e593781b1d3b36d5d470e5e7cd5686ec69fb54f6994",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c8fd00f0bab6a3ceefd088ecece212ef8c8c773322ddd629534bb028ae73508",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
